r\nco=# select count(*) from part where p_partkey = 1;\r\n count  \r\n--------\r\n 182436\r\n(1 row)\r\n```\r\nThe reason is that upon the first invocation PgDmlRead::Exec removes primary key binds and puts ybctid into the request instead.\r\nAfter request is done, the ybctid is gone, too, and subsequent execs with new bounds make full scans of the respective ranges instead. \n\n### Issue Type\n\nkind/bug\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-12405]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-12405?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"sushantrmishra","id":7229015,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcyMjkwMTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7229015?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra","html_url":"https://github.com/sushantrmishra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sushantrmishra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/23491/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/